// 安裝程式：安裝、更新、移除應用與它們的權限（rucloud 的 [install]），以及主畫面的我的最愛
{
  "name": "installer",
  "main": "src/worker.js",
  "compatibility_date": "2025-11-16",
  "assets": { "directory": "./public", "binding": "ASSETS" },
  "d1_databases": [{ "binding": "DB", "database_name": "installer", "database_id": "local" }],
  "r2_buckets": [{ "binding": "PKG", "bucket_name": "installer" }]
}
